    "body": "FYI: #1205 (now on main) replaced the `chord_dip` hole-wall grant with `hole_wall::wall_excuse`, which measures each facet's sagitta about the declared hole's axis and caps it at `WALL_SAG` (0.05 mm), so a flat is no longer excused. That appears to cover this issue; `hole_wall_flats` on main pins it. Leaving the decision to close it to the claimant or the maintainer.",
